    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwenyezi Mlungu wagomba na Jeremia achimuamba, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Phundza mapatano ga chilagane hichi na uaambire atu a Juda na aho asagalao Jerusalemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aambire kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa Iziraeli anaamba hivi, ‘Naalaniwe mutu yeyesi ambaye kandagagbwira go mapatano ga chilagane chichi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mapatano nrigoalagiza akare enu agagbwire niriphoatuluza kula tsi ya Misiri, kula kpwa moho mkali wa kuyayusa vyuma.’ Nchiambira, ‘Niphundzani na muhende chila chitu ninachokulagizani. Muchihenda hivyo mundakala atu angu nami ndakala Mlungu wenu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ili nitimize chirapho choaapira akare enu kukala nindaapha tsi, tsi yenye rutuba ambayo munasagala hadi rero.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho nami nchijibu nchiamba, “Navikale vivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Katangaze maneno gaga midzi yosi ya Juda na kpwenye barabara zosi za Jerusalemu. Aambire, ‘Phundzani go maneno ga chilagane hichi na mgalunge. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana náenderera kuakanya akare enu hangu nriphoatuluza kula Misiri hadi rero, nchiaambira, asikize maneno gangu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela taayaniogopha wala kuniphundza, ela chila mmwenga wahenda kama moyowe mui urivyomlagiza. Kpwa vira taayalunga malagizo ga chilagane nrichoapha, phahi náarehera lana zosi za kusalunga cho chilagane.’ ”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha ye Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniamba, “Atu a Juda na nyo asagalao Jerusalemu anapanga njama ya kuniasi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akauyira dambi za akare ao, ariorema kuphundza maneno gangu. Akalunga milungu yanjina na kuihumikira. Atu a Iziraeli na atu a Juda akavundza chilagane nrichoika na akare ao. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi, ‘Nindaarehera mashaka ambago taandaweza kugaepuka. Dzagbwe andaniririra, mino sindaaphundza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nyo atu a midzi ya Juda na Jerusalemu andaphiya akairirire yo milungu aifukizirayo uvumba, ela taindaativya ndiphophahwa ni go mashaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana muna milungu minji dza midzi yenu irivyo minji mwi atu a Juda. Na dza barabara zirivyo nyinji Jerusalemu ndivyo murivyo munji mwatu mwa kufukizira uvumba Baali, mlungu wenu wa waibu.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kpwa hivyo Jeremia usiavoyere atu aha, usiniririre kpwa sababu yao, mana sindaaphundza tsetsetse wakati a kpwenye mashaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atu niamendzao taana haki ya kuinjira tsona mwangu nyumbani. Anji aho ni ayi hali ya kukala uyi wao tawuuswa ni sadaka za nyama. Ela nchiatiya adabu, taahamirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati fulani Mwenyezi Mlungu wakuiha mzaituni mnono wenye matunda manono, ela kpwa kuvuma kpwa phepho kali andautiya moho na pandaze ziphye tsetsetse. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iye Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi ariyekuphanda, ndiye achiyekupangira mai gaga, kpwa uyi wa kufukizira Baali uvumba uriohendwa ni atu a Iziraeli na a Juda.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi anagomba kuhusu atu a Anathothi anaoindza uhaio, aambao, “Usitabiri kpwa dzina ra Mwenyezi Mlungu, au hundakuolaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kpwa hivyo Mwenyezi Mlungu, Mlungu wa majeshi anaamba, “Lola, nindaatiya adabu. Avulana aho ndaangamiza kpwa upanga; ana aho alume na achetu andafwa na ndzala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tsona taphana mutu ndiyetiya, mana nindareha mashaka kpwa atu a Anathothi mwaka wao wa kutiywa adabu ndiphofika.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
